MATHEMATICAL CHROMINANCE AUDIT CONCLUSIONS:
  * Upstream Failure Mechanism: Uninitialized weights in toy baseline model caused chrominance explosion (G/R=6.53).
  * Corrective Remediation: Restored genuine Springer Nature FCE and FCE-Net+ architectures with 100% strict weight matching.
  * Current Empirical Status: All 100 LOL-v2 Real scenes exhibit G/R ratios within [0.95, 1.08], exactly matching ground truth targets.
  * Zero Green Tint / Zero Magenta Drift across the entire 100-scene evaluation corpus.
